        "jsCode": "const r = $input.first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { ok: r.ok, status: r.status, attempts: r.attempts, terminal: r.terminal, retryable: r.retryable,\n                  response: r.response, data: r.data === undefined ? null : r.data, url: r.url } }];"
      },
      "id": "f5f1770f-924d-5b4a-93fe-b26538f035c5",
      "name": "Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1300,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## P02 - HTTP with backoff\nInput `{url, method?, query?, body?, headers?, max_attempts?=5, base_ms?=500}`.\n\n- 2xx -> done\n- network error / 408 / 425 / 429 / 5xx -> **retry** after `base_ms * 2^(n-1)` (+jitter, cap 30 s, honours `Retry-After`)\n- other 4xx -> **terminal**, no retry\n\nReturns `{ok, status, attempts, terminal, retryable, response, data}`; never throws - the caller decides.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
